## Working agreement

Run `mise run check` before committing. Run `mise run verify` for integration, browser, artifact, or other product claims that need more than the fast gate.

```bash
mise run setup
mise run check
mise run verify
```

`check` is the fast quality gate. `verify` first runs `check`, then stack-specific work and selected product verification routes from `.harness/verification.toml`. Use `scripts/verify-routes --path path/to/change` while iterating; no selector runs every required automated route.

Do not call a green build or test exit proof of a user journey without observing the relevant result or side effect. Keep manual or credentialed checks as explicit handoff obligations.

## Skills

- `create-project-verification` creates a real proof route when one is missing.
- `maintain-project-verification` updates affected routes after public surface or dependency changes.

Use `SPEC.md` for requirements and `docs/` for durable architecture, decisions, and verification guidance.
